OL,3,ABeatles venue may not play live music  
OL,4,Aon rooftop                             
OL,6,FPlans to create a museum where The     
OL,7,FBeatles performed their last live      
OL,8,Fperformance is expected to be approved 
OL,9,F- but on condition no live music can be
OL,10,Fplayed on the rooftop that made the    
OL,11,FMayfair venue famous.                  
OL,13,FApple Corps Ltd, the company founded by
OL,14,Fthe band, wants to convert 3 Savile Row
OL,15,Finto a seven-floor "cultural experience
OL,16,Fand exhibition" celebrating The        
OL,17,FBeatles, with a basement cafe-bar on   
OL,18,Fthe site of the studio where Let It Be 
OL,19,Fwas recorded in 1969.                  
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
